    "title": "Meteor showers to watch in Utah as the Perseids ramp up - NewsBreak",
    "text": "The next few weeks may bring a celestial triple feature to Utah's skies. What's happening: The Alpha Capricornids shower, which is capable of producing fireballs brighter than the stars, peaks Wednesday, according to the American Meteor Society . State of play: The moon is waxing but still a crescent, and the skies are mostly clear all week. How to watch: Find a dark spot and look up.",
